# Fleet core (S2)

- Hub OCM: `ocm.yml` on `hub`; spokes: `spokes.yml` + `clusteradm join`.
- CSR approval: `roles/ocm/tasks/approve_cluster_csr.yml` (polls join host kubeconfig).
- WireGuard server on umkim-hub `10.10.0.1`; clients dial `wg.umkim.com:51820`.
- `fleet_autonomous: true` → K3s binds mgmt LAN, not only WG IP.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/fleet-ocm-spokes/SKILL.md`.
